{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3e025d292bc960d74be3b84b6090ebc93b8b33df44b3d8d55aba91b8d9ff10cf","ja":"う～ん……いきなりは無理かな～。\nやっぱり、ミルクと砂糖入れる？","zh":"嗯～……一下子可能还是不行吧～。\n果然还是要加牛奶和糖吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"5182fb3fc6c7539fde293a54d368ccb26456de187f7571e5092352b38818a693","ja":"でも、甘くしちゃったらいつもと同じですし、\n演技のためにも、このまま飲まないと……。","zh":"但是，加糖变甜的话就和平时一样了，\n为了演好角色，还是得直接喝下去才行……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5223b86ce2301e02d8be5f9ea215fa6750763699d4e1860058e05b26a7ec7cb7","ja":"無理しても仕方ないと思うけど……。\nちょっとずつ慣れていったらいいよ！","zh":"勉强也没什么用就是了……\n一点一点慢慢习惯就好啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c9f94c4a25ccb5d6789ca043e87df33c99e1a8fd71111e47b6ec729c9d8b752f","ja":"多分、まだちょっと早いんじゃないかな？","zh":"大概现在还稍微有点早吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"31adc1154da49e57f6f213bef9893cb19ec791d8028952fc692828be66d26fd8","ja":"うう……そうかもしれませんね。\n格好良く飲んでみたかったんですけど……","zh":"呜呜……也许确实是这样呢。\n我还想试着帅气地喝下去来着……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d0c7309ebfd1971cc537055ed355ca6f22c7e45310a293af960b681e6d199f9c","ja":"……そっか！　わかりました！\nそれじゃあ甘くして飲みますね！","zh":"……这样啊！我明白了！\n那我加点甜味再喝吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"406e66fc158de2995168dc7321ad36d63caa7f52788e94987e969bef99dbfdd3","ja":"え～っと、ミルクとお砂糖を………………。","zh":"那个～，牛奶和糖………………。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"03300c6f6afe04495e1f0ee1acddb06778d2d7f8e72979d2fb66a48d5ab488e0","ja":"……ええっ！？\nそんなに入れるの！？","zh":"……诶诶！？\n要放那么多吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"d54d802094b327c299ea19708773722c02f5347396d32c487c9861984eefb56c","ja":"はい、これならわたしにも……。","zh":"好的，如果是这个的话我也能……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"4c1890a92a2892329fe69b77bd439dcb5a8547a10f694ceb14f9ad337a8391f4","ja":"ふぅ……甘くて美味しいです♪\nそれにパフェも♪","zh":"呼……好甜好美味♪\n而且芭菲也♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"0f94e7d71c26b14cfc695260d23618c21cd41faee208652bf4c833949ab5ae9d","ja":"えへへっ♪\nやっぱり、美味しく飲むのが一番だよね！","zh":"诶嘿嘿♪\n果然，喝得美味才是最棒的呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"a5cbea2b129a193499a6a7674669397d4760a043fd092faad7f85cc80b1c7d2b","ja":"はい。わたしにはまだ、\nブラックコーヒーは早いですけど……。","zh":"是的。虽然对我来说，\n喝黑咖啡还太早了点……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"63503b66276862f13fe8dbae3907b8c558a1f67e1b3f6ae09a2c8218d385933d","ja":"でも、いつかこの味を\n楽しめるようになれたらいいなって、思いました！","zh":"不过，我也觉得要是哪天\n能学会享受这种滋味就好了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1328.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"de8f798030efa1cc64469a4809d69b52bffe876185059f0d51de84df32d29804","ja":"大人にあこがれる気持ちが、わたしらしく商品を\n伝えることになるかなって。えへへっ♪","zh":"憧憬成为大人的心情，或许能成为我独特的\n商品宣传方式吧。诶嘿嘿♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
